rows.en:
"Nooooo!☆"
Imagining the impact to come, I instinctively shut my eyes.
...But no matter how long I waited, the impact never came.{p}

By the time I finally set foot on the first floor, I was drenched in sweat all over.
...I want to go home.
The front entrance was just ahead.{p}

..........And then.
The door slid open without a sound.
On the other side...{p}

There was another door.
...Huh?
That's strange.{p}

"Well, since you've offered, would you show me the way?"
"Yes, of course.
Shall we go, then...?"{p}

With that, Arai started walking briskly off.
...Where is he going?
Desperate not to lose sight of him, I hurried after Arai.{p}
